# DESIGN.md frontend frame

Source of truth: repo-root `DESIGN.md`.

## Palette
- Canvas: white (`bg-background`)
- Text: Carbon Dark (`text-foreground`) / Pewter (`text-muted-foreground`)
- Sole chromatic accent: Electric Blue `#3E6AE1` (`bg-primary` / `text-primary`) for primary CTAs and focus rings only
- Borders: Cloud Gray (`border-border`); no decorative gradients, glass, or multi-layer shadows

## Type & motion
- Manrope 400 body / 500 headings & controls; no uppercase chrome; normal letter-spacing
- Transitions ~0.33s on color/border only — no hover scale/lift

## Primitives
- Prefer `Button`, `Card`, `Input`, `Tabs`, `Dialog`, AppShell layout
- Buttons: 4px radius, `primary` = Electric Blue, `default` = Carbon solid, `secondary` = white + border
- Cards: flat, hairline border, no shadow; only for interactive work units
- Nav: quiet muted active state — not loud filled blocks

## Don’t
- Warm cream/orange “Mistral” leftovers, purple themes, pill CTAs, emoji UI, frosted marketing chrome inside the app shell
